silm:instances_papers_25_sheaf_gluing_chapters_01_sheaf_basics_local_sections_sections_02_presheaf_of_typed_sections_concrete_anchor_4 silm:hasExample "In 'PresheafOfTypedSectionsConcreteAnchor4', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, the small set of facts known during the half-day overlap that BOTH the vet and the owner must agree on (microchip ID, body-mass quality, household role)." .
